OL,15,FTeletextC64EUltimateG-BMeatloaf edition
OL,17,CAbout                                  
OL,18, "The internet is a massive floppy drive
OL,19, for your C64 with Meatloaf!"           
OL,21,CIntroduction                           
OL,22,FMeatloafGis an ESP32 device that plugs 
OL,23,D]F307G<<                >>F312 B]D1/4  
