OL,0,          BTXT64  GFri 27.11.26 06:06:50
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FMeatloaf                 
OL,3,   EUltimateD]GRead all about it        
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5,   image mounted.                       
OL,7, -BIt is a network adapter.GOpen a URL  
OL,8,   like a file. Talk to REST APIs from  
OL,9,   unmodified BASIC v2, with a JSON     
OL,10,   parser built into the drive.         
OL,12, -BIt is also a printer, a clock, and a 
OL,13,  BWiFi modem.GMore devices in one      
OL,14,   cartridge-sized board than most      
OL,15,   people had on the whole bus.         
OL,17, -BIt has a web app.GThe Meatloaf       
OL,18,   Manipulator lets you search, browse  
OL,19,   and swap disks from a phone or laptop
OL,20,   while the Commodore keeps running.   
OL,22,FMore info:Cgithub.com/idolpx/meatloaf  
OL,23,D]F307G<<                >>F312 B]D3/4  
