OL,5,CHow to launch?                         
OL,6, LaunchingFTeletextC64EUltimateGis done 
OL,7, in a typicalFMeatloafGway, just type:  
OL,9,BLOAD "ML:TELETEXT64",8                 
OL,11, and the program loads itself straight  
OL,12, from the internet.HWow!                
OL,14,CWant your own Meatloaf?                
OL,15, It is pretty easy to make aFMeatloafG  
OL,16, device. All you need is a IEC floppy   
OL,17, connector, some wires and a cheap      
OL,18, ESP32 board.                           
OL,20, But they are also sold as a ready to us
OL,21, package.FMore info:Cstore.cityxen.biz  
